<title>JAPAN: Yokowo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yokowo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.84		vs	   10.52</p>
<p> Operating	   11    million	  vs	  225    million</p>
<p> Current	    106    million	  vs	  279    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 498    million	  vs	 prft 97 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 28.45 yen	  vs     prft 5.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  17 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Yokowo Co Ltd is the largest manufacturer of telescopic rods and car antennas.</p>
</text>
